{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Festival Journey: Venetian Masquerade Collector's Edition",
    "steam_appid": 3776990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776990/extras/0fad88eab41927021ecdff4f8e995863.avif?t=1750149155\" width=600 height=250 /></span>Step into a dazzling celebration in the heart of Venice. While there\u2019s a gentle touch of storytelling to set the scene, the true centerpiece of the game is its rich variety of puzzles and engaging hidden object challenges. Enjoy an atmosphere of festivity and flair, where every new scene is an invitation to explore, solve, and uncover visual delights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Mimi Brook, an aspiring young photographer, as she travels with her family to Venice during its world-famous Carnival. Together, they explore the city\u2019s colorful traditions, mask-filled streets, and breathtaking sights. While the Brooks share touching moments and make lasting memories, you\u2019ll be immersed in a journey packed with hidden object challenges and clever tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in an endless mosaic of gameplay. Every scene is crafted to test your perception, focus, and puzzle-solving skills, ensuring there\u2019s always something new to uncover!<i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Dozens of unique mini-games and beautifully illustrated hidden object scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e A light, family-themed storyline that sets the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Collect numerous carnival-themed souvenirs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Stunning wallpapers and an original soundtrack to enhance the atmospher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Built-in strategy guide to help you along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Achievements to track your progress and replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure offers the perfect blend of visual charm and puzzle-packed fun. With a light narrative to set the tone, it focuses on delivering a relaxing, engaging experience filled with hidden object scenes, mini-games, and delightful surprises around every corner!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776990/extras/0fad88eab41927021ecdff4f8e995863.avif?t=1750149155\" width=600 height=250 /></span>Step into a dazzling celebration in the heart of Venice. While there\u2019s a gentle touch of storytelling to set the scene, the true centerpiece of the game is its rich variety of puzzles and engaging hidden object challenges. Enjoy an atmosphere of festivity and flair, where every new scene is an invitation to explore, solve, and uncover visual delights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Mimi Brook, an aspiring young photographer, as she travels with her family to Venice during its world-famous Carnival. Together, they explore the city\u2019s colorful traditions, mask-filled streets, and breathtaking sights. While the Brooks share touching moments and make lasting memories, you\u2019ll be immersed in a journey packed with hidden object challenges and clever tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in an endless mosaic of gameplay. Every scene is crafted to test your perception, focus, and puzzle-solving skills, ensuring there\u2019s always something new to uncover!<i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Dozens of unique mini-games and beautifully illustrated hidden object scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e A light, family-themed storyline that sets the scene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Collect numerous carnival-themed souvenirs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Stunning wallpapers and an original soundtrack to enhance the atmospher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Built-in strategy guide to help you along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Achievements to track your progress and replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure offers the perfect blend of visual charm and puzzle-packed fun. With a light narrative to set the tone, it focuses on delivering a relaxing, engaging experience filled with hidden object scenes, mini-games, and delightful surprises around every corner!</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore Venice through puzzles and hidden objects in this festive journey \u2014 light on story, rich in fun!",
